[00:01.08]Ever onward, O my people,
[00:04.12]Let the Kingdom tidings go.
[00:07.96]Tremble not before our foe.
[00:11.68]Let all lovers of truth know
[00:15.02]That my reigning Son, Christ Jesus,
[00:19.04]To the earth has cast the foe,
[00:22.74]Soon to bind the Devil, Satan,
[00:26.16]Letting all his victims go.
[00:31.21](Chorus)
[00:31.36]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[00:35.88]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[00:44.55]I will keep my faithful servant
[00:52.38]As the apple of my eye.
[00:56.96]Even though your foes are many,
[01:05.08]Though they threaten and revile,
[01:10.20]Though they flatter and they smile,
[01:13.74]To mislead and to beguile.
[01:17.98]Fear them not, my faithful people,
[01:21.36]Nor their persecution’s heat,
[01:25.00]For I will preserve the faithful
[01:26.26]Till the vict’ry is complete.
[01:33.37](Chorus)
[01:33.52]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[01:38.76]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[01:46.94]I will keep my faithful servant
[01:51.80]As the apple of my eye.
[02:00.92]Never fear you are forgotten;
[02:04.11]I am still your strength and shield.
[02:08.04]Though you die upon the field,
[02:11.92]Even death to me will yield.
[02:15.88]Fear them not who kill the body
[02:19.10]But cannot destroy the soul.
[02:22.66]To the end may you be faithful;
[02:26.36]I will bring you to your goal!
[02:30.99](Chorus)
[02:31.14]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[02:37.70]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[02:45.47]I will keep my faithful servant
[02:50.16]As the apple of my eye.
